# Decision Extraction

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-decision-extraction.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-decision-extraction.md)

## Core stack asks

| Layer | Ask |
|-------|-----|
| Observation | What was directly witnessed about the person receiving care? |
| Event | What happened, when, who was involved? |
| Decision | Was a choice made, by whom, with what evidence, and do we know why? |

**Never ask for Decision:** what happened? (that is Event)

## Required

Decision · Who · Why (or Reason unknown) · Evidence · Alternatives (or unknown) · Outcome (or pending) · Status

## Rules

- Visit/encounter → Event; deliberate treatment/plan choice → Decision  
- Recipient state → Observation; choosing to act on it → Decision  
- Missing why → **Reason unknown** — never invent motives  
- Recommendations ≠ decisions until accepted or acted on  

**Modules:** `src/lib/care-reality-extraction/decisions.ts` · `src/lib/decision-memory`  
